= Matched monomial accounting instrument
2026-11-07 · Development validation; comparison not launched

The compiled instrument places four-column baseline, combined-monomial candidate and identical-baseline A/A under one counter and allocator implementation. Public exponent primitives and fixed-object teardown are now explicit. [pcc:unverified]

