== What was checked
Both 15-module generated arms pass exact forward/reverse source checks and 30 corruption rejections each. One selected native test checks identity and an exceptional public target: results, A/A, stage placement, unchanged geometry/decoder/verification arithmetic and teardown/exponent events. It passes; 414 imported tests are filtered. The release binary compiles and describe mode executes no kernel. Three synthetic parser methods pass, including a setup regression that reverses a query reduction. [pcc:unverified]

== Accounting semantics
The 14 stages, 12 components and 17 event slots retain fixed compilation, calibration, preparation, initial/extra geometry, transport, residual, decoder and forward verification. Fixed object destruction is charged explicitly. Analysis adds the complete fixed cost to every query. Execution is grouped by arm; output is interleaved by target. A/A must match exactly. These are helper-event dimensions, including distinct moduli, not a weighted field or machine-cost model. Allocation bytes are cumulative volume, not peak or net memory. Harness formatting and input parsing are excluded.

